> agenda:
> 
>   - Virtualization (Liam)
>   - SoundWire (Liam)
>   - Byte controls (Vinod)
>   - GObject introspection for language bindings (Sakamoto-san)
>   - Integrating the ALSA control core (Sakamoto-san)
>   - AGL (Stephane/Ronan)
>   - Y2038 (broonie)
>   - AVB (Liam)
>   - DSPs (Liam)
>    - Sound Open Firmware
> 
